  "unreadable": [
    "O and 0 look alike in the diagram font. The IO/GPIO prefixes are letters, and the following digit (and the one in UART0) is recorded as 0 (e.g. GPIO0_A0_u, RM_IO0, UART0_TX)."
  ],
  "uncertain": [],
  "notes": "Light-blue numbers beside each GPIO (0, 1, 22, 41...) are listed first in functions as an alternate spelling. Each GPIO also has a '3.3V' voltage tag, recorded as a function. Skipped: a DSI FPC connector at the top and the USB2/SIM area and small pad block at the bottom (no per-pin labels)."
